"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-gBG4d2t8' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-04 17:55:04.045 xcodebuild[27258:109274282]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-04 17:55:04.243 xcodebuild[27258:109274279] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n811ac5ecfb6b63e5b99d3435f26378a592497108 docs(orchestrator): the definitive workload W run fails with the incremental fix; trace attribution absent; escalation to the owner\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-6KhDdbf3' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-04 17:55:05.491 xcodebuild[27265:109274335]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-04 17:55:05.689 xcodebuild[27265:109274334] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-CcX8G3U1' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-04 17:55:06.273 xcodebuild[27270:109274357]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-04 17:55:06.460 xcodebuild[27270:109274356] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure/prelude.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelud